# XSH sigemptyset()
# Copyright (c) 2026 Nicholas Martin. All rights reserved.

assertion  XSH.sigemptyset.001
anchor     functions/sigemptyset.html#DESCRIPTION
class      required
since      1988
says       sigemptyset() on a set that held every signal (from sigfillset())
           returns 0, and then none of the table's signals, nor SIGRTMIN or
           SIGRTMAX, is a member.
uses       XSH.sigismember.001
test       t/001-excludes-all.c
